# =============================================================================
# NEOTH — .gitignore
# Binary crate: Cargo.lock is KEPT (reproducible builds, per Rust convention)
# =============================================================================

# --- Cargo build artifacts ---
/target/
# Cargo workspace lives under SRC/, so its target/ needs ignoring too.
SRC/target/
**/target/

# --- Secrets & local config ---
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- NEOTH runtime data (never commit user data) ---
~/.neoth/
.neoth/
freedom.yaml.local

# --- Large binary assets (pulled from HuggingFace at runtime) ---
models/*.gguf
models/*.bin
models/*.safetensors
models/*.pt
models/*.onnx

# --- Regenerable test data ---
tests/data/*.wal
tests/data/*.bin
tests/data/*.snap.bak

# --- Logs & temp ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- OS ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- IDEs ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/
!.vscode/tasks.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.fleet/
.zed/

# --- Coverage ---
lcov.info
tarpaulin-report.html
coverage/

# --- Profiling ---
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg
cachegrind.out.*
callgrind.out.*

# --- Benchmark artifacts ---
criterion/

# --- cargo-fuzz ---
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/

# --- graphify code-graph artifacts (regenerable; graph.json is ~24MB) ---
graphify-out/
**/graphify-out/
.graphify_python
# NEOTH self-map vault: keep the Obsidian markdown map, drop the heavy HTML/JSON copies
SRC/neothd/assets/obsidian_vault/NEOTH-Self/*.html
SRC/neothd/assets/obsidian_vault/NEOTH-Self/*.json

# --- Upstream research clones + private operator notes ---
# QUELLEN/ contains third-party forks (Hermes, OpenClaw, agentmemory, etc.)
# with their own licenses + 1.7 GB of upstream code. Public push would
# violate the upstream licenses AND blow up GitHub's repo size limits.
QUELLEN/
# RECON/ contains operator-private recon dumps (jarvis_live_recon_*.txt,
# OpenClaw upstream audits). Not for public consumption. Anchored to the repo
# root so it never shadows the `src/recon/` source module on case-insensitive
# filesystems (Windows/macOS).
/RECON/
# REVIEWS/ holds raw third-party security reviews + the _gold_audit exploit-detail
# dumps + Gold-feature research files. Publishing them = an attack map against the
# live beta. The distilled, public-safe plan lives in PLAN/ROAD_TO_1_0_GOLD.md.
REVIEWS/
# Stray Windows artefact when commands accidentally redirect to `nul`
# inside Git Bash. Never tracked.
nul

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored.
# neothd is a binary crate → lock file ensures reproducible CI builds.

# Operator-personal Claude Code hook config (machine-specific paths) — never publish
.github/hooks/

# --- Serena MCP tooling state (cache, memories, project.yml) ---
# Machine-local inference cache — never belongs in the public repo.
.serena/

# --- Local MSVC / build helper scripts ---
# check_msvc.bat is operator-local. Public underscore-prefixed wrappers at the
# Cargo-workspace root (`SRC/`) are portable and intentionally tracked.
SRC/neothd/check_msvc.bat
# Belt-and-suspenders: catch future operator batch scripts in crate roots.
SRC/**/*.bat
!SRC/_*.bat

# Python bytecode caches (plugin-sdk examples)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Agent scratch logs at repo root
/check_output.txt
